+`DECISION_RECORD_moving_records_sources_carriers_20260921.md`: one page for the owner on blocks 39-46 (open PRs #8530, #8546, #8547, #8548, #8549, #8550, #8553, #8554): what is established, what the gravity lane on main actually has (a supplied field equation; three named missing pieces; no committed dynamics in either layer), the correspondence of form between the wind law and the weak-field packet, the forks that are the owner's (glue or the neutral scale; the odds of unformed sites as conditions; inertia; whether an encounter may re-draw a record's content; capture and transparency; the rule's weights are not yet in the inertial clause), the cost of the capture picture in one inequality, and the supervisor's recommendation. Campaign controls executed after block 45 (transparent bodies; no sound without re-drawing) are recorded there and queued on ai/probes.
